# Accepted risk: node-tar CVEs in Next.js's VENDORED copy
# (node_modules/next/dist/compiled/tar). This is not a resolvable npm
# dependency, so `npm audit` is clean and `overrides` cannot touch it; only a
# future `next` release that re-vendors tar will clear it. The compiled tar is
# used by Next's build/CLI tooling, not reachable from the running server, so
# the DoS/path-traversal risk does not apply to the runtime workload.
# Re-review when bumping next.
CVE-2026-26960
CVE-2026-29786
CVE-2026-31802
CVE-2026-59874
CVE-2026-73566

